{"id":143463283959116,"type":"album","name":"Peasant","artist":"Richard Dawson","year":2017,"weight":10,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/80519-peasant_162923.jpg","aoty":84,"aoty_user":81,"yt":"jfaW-yD7DoA","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/richard-dawson/peasant","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/80519-richard-dawson-peasant.php"},"desc":"Peasant was released on 2 June 2017. No listener to Dawson’s earlier music has ever discerned a lack of artistic ambition. Whether they got on at the last stop - the 4 track Tyneside-Trout-Mask-through a-Vic and Bob-filter of Nothing Important - or earlier in the journey, with The Glass Trunk’s visceral song cycle or The Magic Bridge’s sombre revels, devotees of his earlier recordings will be at once intrigued by and slightly fearful of the prospect of a record that could make those three landmark releases look like formative work. Peasant is that album. From its first beguilingly muted fanfare ."},"artist_ref":{"id":101393260292915,"name":"Richard Dawson","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":223327500886715,"type":"genre","name":"Contemporary Folk","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":247,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":133750237876598,"type":"genre","name":"Avant-Folk","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":211,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":117566163487916,"type":"genre","name":"Progressive Folk","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":206,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":46651221575583,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Progressive Folk","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":23,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":173758478099223,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Avant-Folk","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":27,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":87310548737747,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Contemporary Folk","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":194,"year"